{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And the sons of Gad and the sons of Reuben answered, saying, etc. — \"We will cross over\"</b> — They said to him: Our master has no need to command us with a doubled condition. Far be it from your servants to transgress what my master commands, for they are the words of HaShem, and we shall not transgress His commandment. This is the meaning of <b>that which HaShem has spoken</b>, for at first they said, \"as my master commands\" (Numbers 32:25)."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:09:58.423971534Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}